rows.translation_en:
@Who should go on the next sortie?
Which weapons would be best?
What spells has everyone learned?

@Is anyone tired?
How is everyone's Loyalty to the %@ clan?
Who should have a child next?

@Puzzling over those difficult questions
is your job, %$!! All I do
is gather the information!! Understood!?

@Then, if there's a Selection Tournament
for the Shutendoji-hunting force that month,
choose whether to go hunting or compete!!

@You'll visit all of them sooner or later,
so it doesn't matter where you start.
Trust your instincts and go for it!

@But don't overdo it while you're learning.
Don't go too deep, and try to finish up
and return within one month.

@For now, just bring the whole party
home safely!! That's enough!!
That's all I'm praying for.

@Compare your Offering Points, Family Tree
and the deities' abilities. When someone
feels right, select Confirm.

@During the Rite of Divine Union,
your entire family must unite their hearts
for a whole month.
